   "subject": "How to customize the order facet_grid?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div><br></div><div>I am wondering if I want change the order of &quot;8,6,4&quot; to &quot;8,4,6&quot;. How to do that with facet_grid? Thank you very much. <br><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-pCo0sCQdr1Q/UqAP5qj-pVI/AAAAAAAAAAM/NvfqHFjV02E/s1600/facet_grid-57.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-pCo0sCQdr1Q/UqAP5qj-pVI/AAAAAAAAAAM/NvfqHFjV02E/s1600/facet_grid-57.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371596493000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3l6rMqa4bdb6JRrcUK3cor\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-pCo0sCQdr1Q/UqAP5qj-pVI/AAAAAAAAAAM/NvfqHFjV02E/s320/facet_grid-57.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\"></a></p><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lTyHgbvT4FkJ",
   "from": "Ben Bond-Lamberty",
   "author": "f4249b01b99d0091",
   "date": "2013-12-05T14:55:30Z",
   "subject": "Re: How to customize the order facet_grid?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You want to make whatever variable that is a factor and order it in that sequence before plotting, e.g.<div><br></div><div>mydata$yvar &lt;- factor(mydata$yvar,levels=c(8,4,6))</div><div><br></div><div>Then ggplot will respect your set level order.</div>\r\n<div>Ben</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Dec 5, 2013 at 12:33 AM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ianzh...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n</div></div>"
    ],
